###### SHADOW-PROBLEM — endpoint yang jelek/buruk secara kode saat ini ######
### JANGAN dipakai untuk flow normal. File ini untuk membuktikan temuan audit
### branch shadow (lihat AUDIT-SHADOW-KODE.md) sebelum diperbaiki.
### Tiap blok menjelaskan KENAPA JELEK + lokasi kode sumber.
### Urutan coba yang disarankan: B2 → B5/B7 → B12 → rute mati.
### (B1/B4/B6/B8 sudah tertutup: refund dihapus dari model.)


### ========================================
### B2 (TINGGI) — Jalur uang ganda: pelunasan manual invoice tanpa Payment record
### Lokasi: invoice-core InvoiceController.applyPayment + DevRoleSeeder (kasir pegang invoice.update)
### Efek: sales.billing bergerak, sales.cash DIAM → dashboard terlihat "uang hilang".
### Keputusan yang ditunggu: tutup/ketatkan endpoint ini, atau jadikan koreksi admin saja.
### ========================================

### B2: pelunasan manual parsial — kas tidak bergerak, cek dashboard lalu bandingkan sales.cash vs sales.billing
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 20000
}

### B2: cek invoice-nya (status berubah, tapi tidak ada Payment record baru di GET /payments?targetId=1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### B5/B7 (SEDANG) — Angka dashboard yang mudah disalahbaca
### B5: recentActivity.totalPrice = total ORDER, billingStatus = status INVOICE (dua objek satu baris)
### B7: outstandingInvoices/Amount = SNAPSHOT hari ini, tetangganya per periode
### Lokasi: report-core ReportServiceImpl
### ========================================

### B5/B7: tarik dashboard lalu baca dengan curiga —
### recentActivity[].totalPrice vs billingStatus, outstanding vs angka periode
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### B12 (RENDAH): periode masa depan diterima → semua nol tanpa peringatan (seolah "tidak ada penjualan")
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/dashboard/summary?from=2099-01-01&to=2099-01-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### RUTE MATI — sudah tidak ada di controller (ekspektasi 404/405)
### Dulu ada di payment.http sebagai blok DEPRECATED; dipindah ke sini supaya
### payment.http hanya berisi modul payment saat ini. Lokasi: PaymentController
### (tanpa pay/PUT/PATCH/DELETE) + PaymentPutRequest/PatchRequest sudah dihapus.
### ========================================

### MATI: POST /payments/{id}/pay (status hanya via webhook Xendit / provider INTERNAL saat create)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/1/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### MATI: PUT /payments/{id}
PUT {{baseUrl}}/payments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "targetType": "INVOICE",
    "targetId": 1
}

### MATI: PATCH /payments/{id}
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/payments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "paymentDetail": "0000987654321"
}

### MATI: DELETE /payments/{id}
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/payments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### MATI: POST /payments/{id}/refund (refund dihapus dari model — 404/405)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/1/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### MATI: POST /invoices/{id}/refunds (refund dihapus dari model — 404/405)
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "orderItemIds": [2]
}
